---
import {
  BANK_SIZE,
  OPTION_KEYS,
  OUTLINE_TEMPLATE,
  PUBLISH_QUESTIONS,
  SOURCE_GUIDES,
  THINKING_STEPS,
  TOPIC_EXAMPLES,
  TOPIC_OPTIONS,
  VERDICTS,
} from '../lib/quiz-challenge.mjs';
import { BANK_ORGANIZER_PROMPT } from '../lib/quiz-prompts.mjs';
import { QUIZ_COURSE } from '../content/quiz-course.mjs';

const lesson = QUIZ_COURSE.lessonOne;
---

<section class="qz-section qz-warmup" data-warmup aria-labelledby="warmup-title">
  <div class="qz-section-heading">
    <p class="qz-kicker">warm-up / 10 秒竞猜</p>
    <h2 id="warmup-title">{lesson.warmup.title}</h2>
    <p>{lesson.warmup.lead}</p>
  </div>
  <fieldset class="qz-warmup-options" data-warmup-options>
    <legend class="sr-only">选一个你觉得正确的答案</legend>
    {lesson.warmup.options.map((option) => (
      <button class="qz-warmup-option" type="button" data-warmup-option={option.key}>
        <span class="qz-warmup-key" aria-hidden="true">{option.key}</span>
        <span>{option.text}</span>
      </button>
    ))}
  </fieldset>
  <p class="qz-warmup-result" data-warmup-result role="status" hidden></p>
  <button class="qz-button qz-button--quiet" type="button" data-warmup-reveal>直接揭晓答案</button>
  <div class="qz-warmup-answer" data-warmup-answer hidden>
    <strong>正确答案：{lesson.warmup.answer}</strong>
    <p>{lesson.warmup.explanation}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="qz-section" aria-labelledby="standards-title">
  <div class="qz-section-heading">
    <p class="qz-kicker">mission 01 / 好题标准</p>
    <h2 id="standards-title">一道合格的好题，要过五道关。</h2>
    <p>五个标准缺一不可。尤其是「唯一」：如果两个选项都能算对，这道题就必须重写。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="qz-standard-grid">
    {lesson.standards.map((standard, index) => (
      <article class="qz-standard-card">
        <span class="qz-standard-mark" aria-hidden="true">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
        <strong>{standard.title}</strong>
        <p>{standard.detail}</p>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="qz-section" aria-labelledby="risk-title">
  <div class="qz-section-heading">
    <p class="qz-kicker">mission 01 / AI 也会犯糊涂</p>
    <h2 id="risk-title">AI 生成的初稿，不能直接相信。</h2>
    <p>它能帮我们找灵感、写草稿，但不能替我们做事实判断。出题官的黄金铁律是：AI 帮我们找灵感，不能替我们做判断。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="qz-rule-grid">
    {lesson.risks.map((risk, index) => (
      <article class="qz-rule-card">
        <span class="qz-rule-mark" aria-hidden="true">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
        <strong>{risk.title}</strong>
        <p>{risk.detail}</p>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="qz-section" data-topic-section aria-labelledby="topic-title">
  <div class="qz-section-heading">
    <p class="qz-kicker">mission 02 / 第一关</p>
    <h2 id="topic-title">选一个真正好奇、足够聚焦的主题。</h2>
    <p>不要写泛泛的「动物」，改成「动物奇葩睡觉姿势」才有意思。主题会写进你的出题提示词和最终题库文件。</p>
  </div>

  <fieldset class="qz-topic-grid" data-topic-options>
    <legend class="sr-only">选择一个知识主题</legend>
    {TOPIC_OPTIONS.map((topic) => (
      <label class="qz-topic-card">
        <input type="radio" name="quiz-topic" value={topic.id} data-topic-radio />
        <strong>{topic.label}</strong>
        <small>{topic.hint}</small>
      </label>
    ))}
  </fieldset>

  <label class="qz-field">
    <span>把主题写得更聚焦 <em>必填</em></span>
    <input
      type="text"
      maxlength="60"
      autocomplete="off"
      data-topic-custom
      placeholder="例如：动物奇葩睡觉姿势"
    />
  </label>
  <p class="qz-feedback" data-topic-feedback role="status">选一个方向，再把它改成一个具体的题目范围。</p>
</section>

<section class="qz-section" aria-labelledby="prompt-title">
  <div class="qz-section-heading">
    <p class="qz-kicker">mission 02 / 第二关</p>
    <h2 id="prompt-title">用出题模板，请 AI 生成 10 道初稿。</h2>
    <p>模板只有六行，但三块积木都在：设定角色、明确任务、立好边界。把【我的主题】换成你刚才写的主题，再发给课堂智能体。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="qz-prompt-sheet">
    <h3>PPT 原版出题模板</h3>
    <pre class="qz-output" tabindex="0">{OUTLINE_TEMPLATE}</pre>
  </div>

  <div class="qz-prompt-sheet">
    <h3>替换主题后的专属出题指令</h3>
    <p>主题没填时会显示「待补充」，不会替你编一个。</p>
    <pre class="qz-output" data-outline-output tabindex="0"></pre>
    <div class="qz-copy-row">
      <button class="qz-button qz-button--secondary" type="button" data-copy-outline>复制出题提示词</button>
    </div>
    <p class="qz-feedback" data-outline-feedback role="status"></p>
  </div>

  <ol class="qz-step-line">
    <li><strong>替换主题词</strong><span>把模板里的【我的主题】换成你选好的具体主题。</span></li>
    <li><strong>发送给 AI</strong><span>粘进课堂智能体，等 10 道题全部生成。</span></li>
    <li><strong>通读初稿</strong><span>看不懂的地方请 AI 重写，但不要直接相信答案。</span></li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="qz-section qz-section--ink" aria-labelledby="verify-title">
  <div class="qz-section-heading">
    <p class="qz-kicker">mission 03 / 答案侦探</p>
    <h2 id="verify-title">AI 生成 ≠ 事实正确。</h2>
    <p>从出题官变身答案侦探。每道题都要找到能支持答案的权威原文，而不是再问另一个 AI「对不对」。</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="qz-step-line qz-step-line--ink">
    {THINKING_STEPS.map((step) => (
      <li><strong>{step.title}</strong><span>{step.prompt}</span></li>
    ))}
  </ol>
  <p class="qz-note qz-note--ink">侦探铁律：打开权威网页看全文和证据出处，不要只看搜索引擎自动生成的两行摘要。</p>
</section>

<section class="qz-section" aria-labelledby="source-title">
  <div class="qz-section-heading">
    <p class="qz-kicker">mission 03 / 信源导航</p>
    <h2 id="source-title">去哪里找最硬的证据？</h2>
    <p>优先使用国家级科普平台、专业科学机构和正规出版社的科普书。链接状态只按本机实测标注，没验证的不会写成「已验证」。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="qz-source-grid">
    {SOURCE_GUIDES.map((source) => (
      <article class="qz-source-card">
        <strong>{source.name}</strong>
        <code>{source.host}</code>
        <p>{source.description}</p>
        <span class="qz-source-state" data-verified={source.verified ? 'true' : 'false'}>
          {source.verified ? '首页已实测可访问' : '链接未验证'}
        </span>
        {source.href ? (
          <a href={source.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">打开网站 ↗</a>
        ) : (
          <span class="qz-source-state">入口由老师当堂指定</span>
        )}
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="qz-section" aria-labelledby="verdict-title">
  <div class="qz-section-heading">
    <p class="qz-kicker">mission 03 / 四种裁决</p>
    <h2 id="verdict-title">给每道题盖一个结论印章。</h2>
    <p>只有「正确 · 准予通过」的题，才允许进入下节课的游戏。</p>
  </div>
  <ul class="qz-verdict-legend">
    {VERDICTS.map((verdict) => (
      <li data-tone={verdict.tone}>
        <strong>{verdict.label}</strong>
        <span>{verdict.description}</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="qz-section" aria-labelledby="record-title">
  <div class="qz-section-heading">
    <p class="qz-kicker">mission 03 / 20 分钟行动</p>
    <h2 id="record-title">每道题，留下六条核验记录。</h2>
    <p>证据不能只留在脑子里。把来源和原文摘录写下来，别人才能复查你的判断。</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="qz-record-list">
    {lesson.verifyRecord.map((item, index) => (
      <li><span aria-hidden="true">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>{item}</li>
    ))}
  </ol>
  <p class="qz-note">查不到可靠证据怎么办？换个更具体的搜索关键词；仍然找不到，就果断淘汰这道题，换一道备用题。</p>
</section>

<section class="qz-section" data-bank-section aria-labelledby="bank-title">
  <div class="qz-section-heading">
    <p class="qz-kicker">workbench / 题库工作台</p>
    <h2 id="bank-title">把 10 道题逐题查证，再决定谁能进游戏。</h2>
    <p>下面是 {BANK_SIZE} 个题位。先粘贴 AI 初稿，再逐题补上核验关键词、来源、证据和结论。内容只在这个浏览器里，不会上传。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="qz-bank-toolbar">
    <div class="qz-bank-progress">
      <span>初稿完成 <strong data-draft-count>0 / {BANK_SIZE}</strong></span>
      <span>核验通过 <strong data-verified-count>0 / {BANK_SIZE}</strong></span>
      <span data-ready-state="false">还不能进入游戏</span>
    </div>
    <button class="qz-button qz-button--secondary" type="button" data-check-bank>检查我的题库</button>
  </div>

  <div class="qz-question-list">
    {Array.from({ length: BANK_SIZE }, (_, index) => (
      <details class="qz-question-card" data-question-card={index + 1}>
        <summary>
          <span class="qz-question-number" aria-hidden="true">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
          <span class="qz-question-title">
            <span data-question-summary={index + 1}>第 {index + 1} 题：还没有题干</span>
            <small data-question-meta={index + 1}>未开始</small>
          </span>
          <span class="qz-status-pill" data-question-pill={index + 1} data-state="empty">未开始</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="qz-question-body">
          <div class="qz-question-fields">
            <label class="qz-field qz-field--span-2">
              <span>题目内容 <em>必填</em></span>
              <textarea rows="2" maxlength="240" data-question={index + 1} data-field="question" placeholder="把 AI 初稿里的题干粘贴到这里"></textarea>
            </label>
          </div>

          <div class="qz-options-grid">
            {OPTION_KEYS.map((key, optionIndex) => (
              <label class="qz-option-row">
                <span class="qz-option-key" aria-hidden="true">{key}</span>
                <span class="sr-only">选项 {key}</span>
                <input
                  type="text"
                  maxlength="120"
                  autocomplete="off"
                  data-question={index + 1}
                  data-option={optionIndex}
                  placeholder={'选项 ' + key}
                />
              </label>
            ))}
          </div>

          <div class="qz-verdict-row">
            <label class="qz-field qz-answer-field">
              <span>正确答案</span>
              <select data-question={index + 1} data-field="answer">
                <option value="">待确认</option>
                {OPTION_KEYS.map((key) => <option value={key}>{key}</option>)}
              </select>
            </label>
            <label class="qz-field">
              <span>核验结论</span>
              <select data-question={index + 1} data-field="verdict">
                <option value="">还没核验</option>
                {VERDICTS.map((verdict) => <option value={verdict.id}>{verdict.label}</option>)}
              </select>
            </label>
          </div>

          <div class="qz-question-fields">
            <label class="qz-field qz-field--span-2">
              <span>答案解释 <em>必填</em></span>
              <textarea rows="2" maxlength="360" data-question={index + 1} data-field="explanation" placeholder="答错时也要让人学到知识"></textarea>
            </label>
            <label class="qz-field">
              <span>核验关键词</span>
              <input type="text" maxlength="120" autocomplete="off" data-question={index + 1} data-field="keywords" placeholder="用顿号分开，例如：章鱼、心脏" />
            </label>
            <label class="qz-field">
              <span>查证来源</span>
              <input type="text" maxlength="180" autocomplete="off" data-question={index + 1} data-field="source" placeholder="网站、书名或机构名" />
            </label>
            <label class="qz-field qz-field--span-2">
              <span>支撑证据 <em>摘录 1–2 句原文</em></span>
              <textarea rows="2" maxlength="360" data-question={index + 1} data-field="evidence" placeholder="把权威资料里的原句抄下来，不要只写「网上说的」"></textarea>
            </label>
            <label class="qz-field qz-field--span-2">
              <span>优化改动 <em>选填</em></span>
              <textarea rows="2" maxlength="200" data-question={index + 1} data-field="revision" placeholder="如果改过题目，写下最终定稿和改动原因"></textarea>
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="qz-check-result" data-bank-check data-ok="false" role="status" aria-live="polite">
    <p data-bank-check-text>还没有检查。把题目和核验记录填完后，点「检查我的题库」。</p>
    <ul data-bank-issues hidden></ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="qz-section" aria-labelledby="download-title">
  <div class="qz-section-heading">
    <p class="qz-kicker">deliverables / 带走题库</p>
    <h2 id="download-title">正式题库、工程文件，各存一份。</h2>
    <p>Markdown 给人读，JSON 给程序读，工程文件留给下节课继续。三个文件都只包含通过了核验的题。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="qz-download-grid">
    <article class="qz-download-card">
      <strong>主题名称.md</strong>
      <p>按题库整理格式导出的 Markdown，方便阅读、修改和扩充。</p>
      <button class="qz-button qz-button--quiet" type="button" data-download-md>下载 Markdown</button>
    </article>
    <article class="qz-download-card">
      <strong>主题名称.json</strong>
      <p>标准 JSON 题库，供下节课的游戏直接读取。</p>
      <button class="qz-button qz-button--quiet" type="button" data-download-json>下载 JSON</button>
    </article>
    <article class="qz-download-card">
      <strong>quiz-project-v1.json</strong>
      <p>带核验证据和改动的工程文件，是第 2 节课的入口。</p>
      <button class="qz-button qz-button--secondary" type="button" data-export-project>保存第 1 版工程</button>
    </article>
  </div>
  <p class="qz-feedback" data-download-feedback role="status" aria-live="polite">题库通过检查后，三个下载按钮才会启用。</p>
</section>

<section class="qz-section" aria-labelledby="publish-title">
  <div class="qz-section-heading">
    <p class="qz-kicker">mission 04 / 出题官发布</p>
    <h2 id="publish-title">用四个问题，讲清你的题库。</h2>
    <p>不用背稿。按顺序回答，别人就能听懂你在做什么、为什么值得玩。</p>
  </div>
  <ul class="qz-publish-list">
    {PUBLISH_QUESTIONS.map((question, index) => (
      <li><strong aria-hidden="true">{index + 1}</strong><span>{question}</span></li>
    ))}
  </ul>
  <p class="qz-note">真正厉害的出题官，不只是会用 AI，更知道怎样辨别事实真假。</p>
</section>

<section class="qz-section qz-organizer" aria-labelledby="organizer-title">
  <div class="qz-section-heading">
    <p class="qz-kicker">final tool / 题库整理助手</p>
    <h2 id="organizer-title">AI题库整理与文件生成助手</h2>
    <p>完成 10 道核验题后，把下面这段提示词原样复制给 AI，再附上你的题目。它会按固定格式整理成 Markdown 和 JSON 两个文件。</p>
  </div>
  <pre class="qz-output qz-output--tall" data-organizer-output tabindex="0">{BANK_ORGANIZER_PROMPT}</pre>
  <div class="qz-copy-row">
    <button class="qz-button qz-button--primary" type="button" data-copy-organizer>复制提示词</button>
  </div>
  <p class="qz-feedback" data-organizer-feedback role="status" aria-live="polite">提示词按用户提供的原文呈现，没有改写或精简。</p>
</section>

<script>
  // @ts-nocheck
  import { copyTextToClipboard } from '../lib/ai-planet-builder.mjs';
  import {
    BANK_SIZE,
    OUTLINE_TEMPLATE,
    bankFileName,
    buildBankJson,
    buildBankMarkdown,
    buildOutlinePrompt,
    checkQuestionBank,
    isQuestionVerified,
    verificationProgress,
  } from '../lib/quiz-challenge.mjs';
  import { BANK_ORGANIZER_PROMPT } from '../lib/quiz-prompts.mjs';
  import { buildQuizProjectFileName, stringifyQuizProjectFile } from '../lib/quiz-project-file.mjs';
  import { QUIZ_COURSE } from '../content/quiz-course.mjs';
  import {
    QUIZ_WORKSPACE_EVENT,
    createWorkspaceFile,
    currentTopic,
    setQuestionField,
    setQuestionOption,
    setTopic,
    setTopicCustom,
    workspace,
  } from '../lib/quiz-workspace.mjs';

  const root = document.querySelector('[data-warmup]')?.closest('main');

  const downloadText = (text, fileName, type) => {
    const blob = new Blob([text], { type });
    const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
    const link = document.createElement('a');
    link.href = url;
    link.download = fileName;
    document.body.appendChild(link);
    link.click();
    link.remove();
    window.setTimeout(() => URL.revokeObjectURL(url), 1000);
  };

  if (root) {
    const warmup = QUIZ_COURSE.lessonOne.warmup;

    root.querySelector('[data-warmup-reveal]')?.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
      event.currentTarget.hidden = true;
      const answer = root.querySelector('[data-warmup-answer]');
      if (answer) answer.hidden = false;
    });

    root.querySelectorAll('[data-warmup-option]').forEach((button) => {
      button.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const correct = button.dataset.warmupOption === warmup.answer;
        root.querySelectorAll('[data-warmup-option]').forEach((item) => {
          item.disabled = true;
          item.dataset.state = item.dataset.warmupOption === warmup.answer ? 'correct' : 'idle';
        });
        button.dataset.state = correct ? 'correct' : 'wrong';
        const result = root.querySelector('[data-warmup-result]');
        if (result) {
          result.hidden = false;
          result.dataset.tone = correct ? 'ok' : 'error';
          result.textContent = correct
            ? '答对了！章鱼确实有 3 颗心脏。'
            : '这次没猜中。正确答案是 C：章鱼有 3 颗心脏。';
        }
        const answer = root.querySelector('[data-warmup-answer]');
        if (answer) answer.hidden = false;
      });
    });

    const outlineOutput = root.querySelector('[data-outline-output]');
    const topicInput = root.querySelector('[data-topic-custom]');
    const topicFeedback = root.querySelector('[data-topic-feedback]');
    const draftCount = root.querySelector('[data-draft-count]');
    const verifiedCount = root.querySelector('[data-verified-count]');
    const readyState = root.querySelector('[data-ready-state]');
    const bankCheck = root.querySelector('[data-bank-check]');
    const bankCheckText = root.querySelector('[data-bank-check-text]');
    const bankIssues = root.querySelector('[data-bank-issues]');
    const downloadFeedback = root.querySelector('[data-download-feedback]');

    const renderOutline = () => {
      if (!outlineOutput) return;
      const topic = currentTopic();
      outlineOutput.textContent = topic.label ? buildOutlinePrompt(workspace.topic) : OUTLINE_TEMPLATE;
      if (topicFeedback) {
        topicFeedback.textContent = topic.label
          ? '主题已锁定：' + topic.label + '。现在可以生成专属出题提示词。'
          : '选一个方向，再把它改成一个具体的题目范围。';
        topicFeedback.dataset.tone = topic.label ? 'ok' : 'neutral';
      }
    };

    const renderQuestions = () => {
      const progress = verificationProgress(workspace.questions);
      if (draftCount) draftCount.textContent = progress.drafted + ' / ' + BANK_SIZE;
      if (verifiedCount) verifiedCount.textContent = progress.verified + ' / ' + BANK_SIZE;
      if (readyState) {
        const ready = progress.verified === BANK_SIZE;
        readyState.dataset.ready = String(ready);
        readyState.textContent = ready ? '10 道题已全部通过，可以导出' : '还不能进入游戏';
      }

      workspace.questions.forEach((question) => {
        const card = root.querySelector('[data-question-card="' + question.id + '"]');
        if (!card) return;
        const summary = root.querySelector('[data-question-summary="' + question.id + '"]');
        const meta = root.querySelector('[data-question-meta="' + question.id + '"]');
        const pill = root.querySelector('[data-question-pill="' + question.id + '"]');
        const verified = isQuestionVerified(question);
        const started = Boolean(question.question || question.options.some(Boolean) || question.answer);

        card.dataset.verified = String(verified);
        if (summary) summary.textContent = question.question ? '第 ' + question.id + ' 题：' + question.question : '第 ' + question.id + ' 题：还没有题干';
        if (meta) {
          meta.textContent = verified
            ? '已通过核验 · ' + question.source
            : started
              ? '已开始填写 · 还没有通过核验'
              : '未开始';
        }
        if (pill) {
          pill.dataset.state = verified ? 'verified' : question.verdict && question.verdict !== 'correct' ? 'rejected' : started ? 'draft' : 'empty';
          pill.textContent = verified ? '准予通过' : question.verdict === 'correct' ? '缺少证据' : question.verdict ? '未通过' : started ? '填写中' : '未开始';
        }
      });

      setDownloadsEnabled(progress.verified === BANK_SIZE);
    };

    const setDownloadsEnabled = (enabled) => {
      root.querySelectorAll('[data-download-md], [data-download-json], [data-export-project]').forEach((button) => {
        button.disabled = !enabled;
      });
      if (downloadFeedback) {
        downloadFeedback.textContent = enabled
          ? '题库已通过检查，可以下载三个文件。'
          : '题库通过检查后，三个下载按钮才会启用。';
      }
    };

    const runBankCheck = () => {
      const result = checkQuestionBank(workspace.questions);
      if (bankCheck) bankCheck.dataset.ok = String(result.ok);
      if (bankCheckText) {
        bankCheckText.textContent = result.ok
          ? '10 道题全部通过：题面、4 个选项、答案、解释、来源、证据和关键词都齐了。'
          : '还有 ' + (BANK_SIZE - result.approvedCount) + ' 道题没有通过核验。先处理下面的问题，再导出。';
      }
      if (bankIssues) {
        bankIssues.replaceChildren();
        if (result.issues.length) {
          result.issues.forEach((issue) => {
            const item = document.createElement('li');
            item.textContent = issue;
            bankIssues.appendChild(item);
          });
          bankIssues.hidden = false;
        } else {
          bankIssues.hidden = true;
        }
      }
      setDownloadsEnabled(result.ok);
    };

    root.querySelectorAll('[data-topic-radio]').forEach((radio) => {
      radio.addEventListener('change', () => {
        if (!radio.checked) return;
        setTopic(radio.value);
        if (radio.value === 'custom' && topicInput) topicInput.focus();
      });
    });

    topicInput?.addEventListener('input', () => {
      setTopicCustom(topicInput.value);
      if (workspace.topic.id !== 'custom' && topicInput.value.trim()) {
        setTopic('custom');
        const custom = root.querySelector('[data-topic-radio][value="custom"]');
        if (custom) custom.checked = true;
      }
      renderOutline();
    });

    root.querySelectorAll('[data-question]').forEach((input) => {
      input.addEventListener('input', () => {
        const id = Number(input.dataset.question);
        if (input.dataset.option !== undefined) setQuestionOption(id, Number(input.dataset.option), input.value);
        else if (input.dataset.field) setQuestionField(id, input.dataset.field, input.value);
      });
    });

    root.querySelector('[data-check-bank]')?.addEventListener('click', runBankCheck);

    root.querySelector('[data-copy-outline]')?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const copied = await copyTextToClipboard(outlineOutput?.textContent || '');
      const feedback = root.querySelector('[data-outline-feedback]');
      if (feedback) {
        feedback.textContent = copied ? '已复制。粘到课堂智能体里，等 10 道题全部生成。' : '复制没有成功，请手动选中文字。';
        feedback.dataset.tone = copied ? 'ok' : 'error';
      }
    });

    root.querySelector('[data-download-md]')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const topic = currentTopic();
      const text = buildBankMarkdown({ topic: workspace.topic, questions: workspace.questions });
      downloadText(text, bankFileName(workspace.topic) + '.md', 'text/markdown;charset=utf-8');
    });

    root.querySelector('[data-download-json]')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const json = buildBankJson({ topic: workspace.topic, questions: workspace.questions });
      downloadText(JSON.stringify(json, null, 2) + '\n', bankFileName(workspace.topic) + '.json', 'application/json;charset=utf-8');
    });

    root.querySelector('[data-export-project]')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const file = createWorkspaceFile(1);
      downloadText(stringifyQuizProjectFile(file), buildQuizProjectFileName(1), 'application/json;charset=utf-8');
      workspace.lastExportedVersion = 1;
      if (downloadFeedback) downloadFeedback.textContent = '已保存 quiz-project-v1.json。下节课导入它继续。';
      document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('quiz:exported', { detail: file }));
    });

    root.querySelector('[data-copy-organizer]')?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const copied = await copyTextToClipboard(BANK_ORGANIZER_PROMPT);
      const feedback = root.querySelector('[data-organizer-feedback]');
      if (feedback) {
        feedback.textContent = copied ? '已复制原文提示词。接下来把题目内容发给 AI。' : '复制没有成功，请手动选中整段文字。';
        feedback.dataset.tone = copied ? 'ok' : 'error';
      }
    });

    document.addEventListener(QUIZ_WORKSPACE_EVENT, () => {
      renderOutline();
      renderQuestions();
    });

    renderOutline();
    renderQuestions();
  }
</script>
